S-APGAR incorporates the standards set by the Korean Accreditation Board of Nursing Education, ensuring a structured and comprehensive approach to neonatal health assessment. \nBy providing accurate and standardized procedures, the simulator prepares students for real-world clinical applications.", "short_description": "NS-APGAR is a VR-based simulator designed to help users systematically understand and practice the APGAR scoring system for assessing neonatal health."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "006.NS_A_Portrait.png", "id": "1769186376974618", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392076_1769186380307951_2523111346601453692_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OQjy8SPa0VsQ7kNvwFNkY0F&_nc_oc=Adl2TFiUTs8IoyrDUYYFJj13jno9MFZkOx2ksqAkh1MJKFXuLkTa2Ij6RIUzEnYIcTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwTOXHszgxRKm1YYG9L7LvHF1x_6rzhsny1BQwCFM_LXQ&oe=69B02A8A"}, {"file_name": "007.NS_A_PDP.png", "id": "1687991861790047", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392040_1687991865123380_7775533927646772153_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rx5TtQTSzlcQ7kNvwHOVhFy&_nc_oc=AdkIdw8caJ7ui-xRAS3UxmnUm5YvyD739w2DGgwLA6vW4QRKHCgsYmUxYnl64MgdnhI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afws_299KEUp4rSC4fcf7A4uVdw8L6VmjLS3QWGAicSU-g&oe=69B0240B"}, {"file_name": "014.NS_A.png", "id": "1399777421429818", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392004_1399777424763151_6566675078254540540_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bsawHINwE7wQ7kNvwF5psuB&_nc_oc=Admbj-C_FHpCnpaNbY8oyrf0JP9hz1fbMG2bMbA-nUU2WLlLPBXiTtzpSI-dcwBS8Wg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyCozGkM4k3fWR2mqKKHJ9uDgxjll08Mp79iBtjL6hj9A&oe=69B01B9E"}, {"file_name": "008.NS_A_Mini.png", "id": "1313517853269588", "image_type": 